# Blazing Rootwalla's madness is a choice: discarded to Faithless Looting it is exiled, and when the linked trigger
# resolves Bot1 declines to cast it, so it is put into the graveyard (CR 702.35a) - above the Looting, which finished
# resolving before the trigger went on the stack - and nothing stays in exile. The discard still happened: the Mountain
# chosen beside it is in the graveyard too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Blazing Rootwalla
Faithless Looting
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Blazing Rootwalla; Mountain)
? Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain
Bot1.Graveyard = Blazing Rootwalla; Faithless Looting; Mountain
Exile.Count = 0
